The Terrebonnes have two open front pockets (mesh, inside pants) and one zippered rear pocket (outside pants) that can only fit a phone horizontally but not vertically. The pants do have a non-PFAS DWR finish and use some recycled and some bluesign fabrics. These could be a good option for runners seeking lightweight pants but would prefer something other than the Zpacks Ultralight Trail Cool Joggers, or those who don’t run in hot conditions that require more breathable pants.

